## Cost-Benefit Analysis

| Technique | Token Multiplier | Quality Gain | ROI | When Worth It |
|-----------|------------------|--------------|-----|---------------|
| **Zero-Shot** | 1.0x | Baseline | ★★★ | Simple tasks |
| **Persona** | 1.2x | +20-30% | ★★★ | Domain work |
| **Few-Shot** | 1.5-2x | +30-40% | ★★★ | Repetitive tasks |
| **CoT** | 2-3x | +40-50% | ★★★ | Complex reasoning |
| **Self-Eval** | 2x | +25-35% | ★★ | High-stakes outputs |
| **Tree of Thought** | 3-5x | +30-60% | ★★ | Critical decisions |
| **Modular** | Nx per step | +20-40% | ★★ | Long-form content |

**Key insight:** Stacking 3 techniques yields 2-3x cost but 60-80% quality gain—net positive ROI for important tasks.

