## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

1. **Over-Constraint Paralysis** – Too many contradictory rules
2. **Vague Quality Gates** – "Make it better" without criteria
3. **Example Bias** – Few-shot examples reinforce wrong patterns
4. **Template Ossification** – Using GPT-3.5 prompts on GPT-4
5. **Ignoring Model Strengths** – GPT-4 with basic prompt > GPT-3.5 with perfect prompt
6. **Citation Trust** – Assuming provided sources are real
7. **Prompt Injection Vulnerability** – User inputs contaminating system instructions

