## Key Takeaways

1. **Model > Prompt** – Better model beats perfect prompt on weaker model
2. **Stack Strategically** – 3 techniques = sweet spot (diminishing returns after 5)
3. **Evidence > Anecdote** – Prioritize research-backed methods
4. **Iterate Cheaply** – Test on small tasks before production
5. **Version Everything** – Prompts evolve as models improve
6. **Verify Always** – Especially citations, code, medical/legal info
7. **Security Matters** – Validate inputs, isolate user content

